// Title: Lolbin Runexehelper Use As Proxy
// Sigma ID: cd71385d-fd9b-4691-9b98-2b1f7e508714
// Status: test | Level: medium
// Author: frack113
// Date: 2022-12-29 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: stealth, T1218
// Description: Detect usage of the "runexehelper.exe" binary as a proxy to launch other programs
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://twitter.com/0gtweet/status/1206692239839289344
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/Runexehelper/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_lolbin_runexehelper.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, microsoft_xdr schema)

DeviceProcessEvents
| where InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\runexehelper.exe"
